 "008AED42": {
  "image_top": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Brain-in-a-Jar-Locations/jars-1-32/brain-6-location.avif",
  "n_when_written": 6,
  "image_map": "/wp-content/uploads/guide-images/collectables/Brain-in-a-Jar-Locations/jars-1-32/brain-6-map.avif",
  "directions": "From the spawn above, face east and keep following the river down. This bit is a little tricky: while you walk down the river, keep looking to your left, along the skyline, until you are in line with the red top of the Hawksbill Weather Station. Facing the weather station, walk straight while looking up the hill and hopefully you will see two green tents. There is an enemy spawn at the tents, so even if you miss them the first time, the enemies should see you, start attacking and lead you to the tents. I have STRONG words for the devs who placed this jar spawn here. Once you are standing at the tents, face west and walk to the back of the tent. The Brain in a Jar is behind the two wooden crates on your right."
 },
